# How long check.sh may run on CI's four-core runner before formal.mjs stops it and fails
# naming this model (SLNT-1065, SLNT-1081). With tlx the full bounds took 2.3 minutes on CI (run
# 44103197639) and --quick 3 seconds: about 3.4 minutes on a host 1.5 times slower, and
# budget-full is about twice that. SLNT-1237's start (waiting turns) about doubled the full run
# (53 s to about 100 s locally on 4 workers), so budget-full doubled with it.
budget-quick 5
budget-full 16
